  DisplayName: The Ornate Lamp Falls Out of Favour
  EventType: 1
  Description: A much-read critic of taste {has declared|is about to declare} the
    ornate lamps of the last century the height of vulgarity. Fashionable households
    {are sending|will send} theirs to the salerooms, and collectors {are|will be}
    in no hurry to take them on.
